{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-31T12:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116507479836385615"], "id": "2116507479836385615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 7924, "like_count": 35, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 41, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "据说 Workbuddy 的三大使用场景：\n\n1. 炒股\n2. 大学生写论文\n3. 自媒体内容创作\n\n符合你的想象预期吗？", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116507479836385615"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116215161430347776"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T17:06:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116215180900331783"], "id": "2116215180900331783", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4963, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI Dots 产品形态很需要，但智能程度真垃圾，还说背后用的是 Astra 模型。\n\n同样一个 Computer Use 任务在 Project 的 Session 就能顺利完成，而 Dots 就搞不定。\n\n赶紧优化打磨吧，有点拉胯。\n\n不过，每天让它查下 Github PR 和 Obsidian 插件下载量还挺方便的。 https://t.co/vBSdNXa2Te", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116215180900331783"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116213859002568704"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T17:01:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116213992410820758"], "id": "2116213992410820758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 6000, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "DeepSeek Harness 版本更新太快了。\n\n让 Codex 写一个定时任务，检查版本更新后自动升级插件，哈哈哈。 https://t.co/qZFKvW1Xqj", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116213992410820758"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116199778623315968", "3_2116199859904741376"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:08:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116200606394384451"], "id": "2116200606394384451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 113, "impression_count": 8558, "like_count": 79, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "微信视频号也可以轻松用 AI 总结分析！\n\n复制视频号链接到 Chrome 浏览器，乔木剪藏插件打开。\n\nQwen 0.6b 本地模型转写，就能用 AI 对话了。\n\n插件下载安装地址：\nhttps://t.co/CZVSwDJ0eN https://t.co/Nv7PS2xo3M", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116200606394384451"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116195654334906368", "3_2116195832819269632", "3_2116196094879440896", "3_2116196656299524096"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:02:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116199091441168583"], "id": "2116199091441168583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 5497, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "科学做海外 GEO 必须有数据支撑！\n\n合作伙伴提供了ChatGPT、Gemini 等海外主流 AI 工具 6到 9 月的一千多万抓取数据。\n\n姚老师借 AI做了深度分析，有很多有趣的发现。\n\n明晚 8 点， 姚金刚 @yaojingang 和我会在 WaytoAGI 视频号直播分享。 https://t.co/eFQRFihxuR", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116199091441168583"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116192023988649984"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:43:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116194243077423283"], "id": "2116194243077423283", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 6101, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "AI 变强后，安全问题好像越来越严重了，有点可怕啊。\n\n像马斯克说：每天都是0day！\n\nAI Breakfast 一篇文章写到，一个研究者分析了 725 万个 Gitee 仓库。\n\n平均每 275 个仓库就能找到一个云资源或大模型的 API key。\n\n币安黑客攻击时间在 X 上也沸沸扬扬。\n\nGitHub 提到9 月的 pull request 里，超 https://t.co/TPXagAKfTW", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116194243077423283"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T07:21:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116067950956527999"], "id": "2116067950956527999", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 8630, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115735819231346718", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "明天有空试试，像黑科技！ https://t.co/y0UMJ9Cee1", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116067950956527999"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115996069515722754"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:57:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116001563420586192"], "id": "2116001563420586192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 57, "impression_count": 8308, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 47, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115318655525523714", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "把大家 Vibe Coding 产品做成了一个网站，录屏分享下Grok bot 的开发过程。\n\nhttps://t.co/8sbHJxsYXU https://t.co/GWpvlDRSdw https://t.co/Fz7xqzVhTd", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116001563420586192"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115958811001556993"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:09:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115959252275876147"], "id": "2115959252275876147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 8653, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115318655525523714", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "评论区看到好多网友 Vibe Coding 的有趣作品。\n\n交给 Grok Bot 读取评论，自动整理，开发成一个网站。\n\n不知道能不能搞定，出门路亚钓鱼回来看结果。 https://t.co/JCyWEflYvp https://t.co/Fz7xqzVhTd", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115959252275876147"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115956079318425600"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:59:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115956682291610055"], "id": "2115956682291610055", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 168, "impression_count": 14712, "like_count": 151, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 28}, "text": "有网友私信说能不能把 42 章经的所有播客都总结一遍？\n\n曲凯的 42 章经是国内最优质的 AI 播客之一。\n\n必须安排，昨天花了几个小时从小宇宙转写获取了全部文字稿，用 DeepSeek V4.1-1017 flash 全总结了一遍。\n\nhttps://t.co/fsn0OXYF1t\n\n不过转写因为音频识别问题，可能有幻觉，推荐听原播客 https://t.co/v3PL9HceCp", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115956682291610055"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T23:56:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115955851945193922"], "id": "2115955851945193922", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 49, "impression_count": 20625, "like_count": 62, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2085544999148728811", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "编程只是眼下的热点之一，不应该完全被它牵着走，编程之外还有更多更大的机会。 https://t.co/H725GfTKll", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115955851945193922"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T23:50:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115954352179581161"], "id": "2115954352179581161", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 14091, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 43, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "去年朋友们都在 Vibe Coding 各种软件、网页。\n最近大家都开始 Vibe Coding 各种游戏。\n\n去年是 11 月，opus 4.5 发布\n今年是 9 月底，opus 5.5 发布\n\n最早 Cursor 开始火，也是 sonnet 3.5 发布后接入，让 AI coding 从 Tab 补全，变成真正编程智能体。\n\n不看 Anthropic 这家公司和", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115954352179581161"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115817423316385792"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:49:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115818384881508545"], "id": "2115818384881508545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5039, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "给个人网站加了一个“随想”的栏目。\n\n类似于个人的 X （Twitter），随手想发什么发什么。\n\n提示词很简单：\n\n“帮我增加一个类似 X 发帖功能，支持图片、视频粘贴上传，发布的内容可点击同步到 X 或小红书”\n\n简单调试优化几轮就行了， AI 变强后，真的是“许愿式编程。” https://t.co/3L2AO0yIlb", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115818384881508545"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T14:44:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115817111948054557"], "id": "2115817111948054557", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 5789, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115647146548756686", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "苍何是我好朋友，公众号订阅人数众多。\n\n不仅开源了很多产品和工具，而且对文字和内容非常有追求。\n\n加上程序员出身，他来写如何用好 Codex 相关的书 ，非常合适。\n\n推荐下单购买，我的在路上。 https://t.co/hEBPMefYTf", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115817111948054557"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115689561477246976", "3_2115689814590939136"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:19:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115690083546546607"], "id": "2115690083546546607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 235, "impression_count": 26929, "like_count": 184, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 65, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "腾讯新出的AI 趣味知识学习社区：懂了鸭\n\nhttps://t.co/x4yxC7Q5sZ\n\n目前在内测，关注官方公众号后回复“内测”能拿到邀请码体验。\n\n看起来是用 HTML +生图等能力创作故事、知识解释，比如给孩子生成绘本。\n\n刚朋友问，搜索注册体验了下。 https://t.co/kr2WXAPasK", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115690083546546607"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116215161430347776", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116213859002568704", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116199778623315968", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116199859904741376", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116195654334906368", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116195832819269632", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116196094879440896", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116196656299524096", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116192023988649984", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2115996069515722754", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115958811001556993", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115956079318425600", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115817423316385792", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115689561477246976", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115689814590939136", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116507479836385615", "oldest_id": "2115690083546546607", "result_count": 15}}